# Slice 1 · Homepage + AI Inbox Mock

*Static SvelteKit · synthetic data · no backend · 3-min walkthrough*

---

## Why

Phase 0 → Phase 1 transition needs one visible artifact.
Until a stranger can land → walk → leave with the product clear, all docs are vapor.
This slice is the first thing showable to a Romanian SME owner.

---

## Scope

```
IN     git init at repo root
       SvelteKit + Svelte 5 + TS + Tailwind scaffold
       routes:  /          home (marketing)
                /demo      demo workflow page
                /app/inbox mock AI Inbox
       static JSON: 4 demo docs from project_control_pack.md §23.3
                    invoice_lumina_design_2026_0041
                    email_accountant_missing_docs_april
                    email_client_apartament_bucuresti
                    contract_supplier_lumina_design
       components:  Sidebar · Inbox list · Doc card · Doc detail panel
                    Approve button states · Audit timeline (mock)
       minimal README pointing at docs + ops/

OUT    backend · real AI · file upload · auth · DB
       Ask My Company chat · Draft Reply panel
       remaining 12 demo documents
       a11y · i18n · animations
```

---

## Acceptance

```
stranger lands at / → reads hero in 10s → clicks to /demo
reads workflow story → clicks to /app/inbox
sees 4 analyzed cards → opens one → sees fields + suggested action + Approve button
total under 3 min · no broken states · feels real
```

---

## Constraints inherited

See `ops/rules.constraints.hybrid` (gravity HIGH · anchored).

